WEBVTT

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.980
Open the Learners tab, and make sure Pretest is selected at the top.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:14.833
The line below shows how many learners already have a numeracy pretest and a reading pretest.

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:17.321
Tap, Num, beside a learner.

00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:21.009
You can also tap the learner, and choose, Numeracy pretest.

00:00:21.809 --> 00:00:26.664
The test level is set by the grade of the learner, and it cannot be changed.

00:00:26.664 --> 00:00:31.903
This way every learner is measured in the same way, so the scores can be compared.

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:33.436
The pretest uses Form A.

00:00:34.236 --> 00:00:36.663
There are three ways to give the test.

00:00:36.663 --> 00:00:39.154
One, the learner answers on this phone.

00:00:39.154 --> 00:00:42.986
Two, the learner answers on paper, and you type the answers.

00:00:42.986 --> 00:00:44.647
Three, you print the test.

00:00:45.447 --> 00:00:48.352
In the first way, hand the phone to the learner.

00:00:48.352 --> 00:00:50.471
The questions appear one at a time.

00:00:50.471 --> 00:00:54.769
The learner taps a choice, or uses the number keys, and then taps Next.

00:01:01.647 --> 00:01:04.514
On the last question, the learner taps Finish.

00:01:04.514 --> 00:01:06.695
The app shows the score right away.

00:01:06.695 --> 00:01:08.004
Then tap Save result.

00:01:08.804 --> 00:01:12.366
In the second way, the learner writes the answers on paper.

00:01:12.366 --> 00:01:14.600
Then you type what the learner wrote.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.437
Leave an answer blank if the learner gave none.

00:01:17.437 --> 00:01:20.879
For fractions, use a slash, for example, three over four.

00:01:21.679 --> 00:01:26.336
In the third way, tap, Print the test, to print it or save it as a PDF.

00:01:26.336 --> 00:01:33.028
After the learner finishes on paper, come back and use, Enter answers from paper, to type the answers.

00:01:33.828 --> 00:01:37.920
When you are done typing, tap, Score this test, and then, Save result.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:43.065
The score is saved on your phone and sent to your district sheet when there is a signal.

00:01:43.865 --> 00:01:49.220
Remember, the pretest is Form A, and the posttest is Form B, at the same level.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:52.676
No question is repeated from one form to the other.
